 Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","review_id":"2LF36zTrh2Ec0B7Gg-GRJA","date":"2019-04-23T15:38:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9424391984939575,"text_excerpt":"I've been here a few times and have generally loved my experiences. The Banh Mi are great and they have veggie Vietnamese egg rolls!!! Which is amazing because my boyfriend doesn't eat pork so we never get to order them together. Taste just like the pork version. The bubble tea is also great here. I think I'd come here if I was craving sandwiches or wanted coffee or bubble tea. Their pho is okay, but not as great as all the other Vietnamese restaurants - it's much more light than others. The family who runs it is super nice and offer great service. The older gentleman who served us was particularly kind."},{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","review_id":"Dt64zs7oeVrMfeFSdLNmTA","date":"2021-12-01T22:07:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398946166038513,"text_excerpt":"I ordered the Vietnamese coffee and the pork belly banh mi. Very tasty!!! Idk what sauce they put on the banh mi, but i could literally drench everything in it lol. I would definitely go back again. I saw a lady beside me order the sweet ginger chicken dish and I will try that next. It looked so good. Also, added bonus they have a friendly staff."},{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","review_id":"-C_yvQs7ocmG8c1pxvTj5g","date":"2020-06-08T19:26:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9382070302963257,"text_excerpt":"Delicious food at a great price. They don't skimp on meat in their banh mi, and they get their bread from Dong Phuong, one of the best bakeries in the area. They dress the banh mi with a seasoned mayo that adds just the right amount of moisture and perfectly balances the different flavors. I also recommend trying out their shrimp bao. They have lots of boba tea flavors. I usually go for mango, but my friends also liked banana and pineapple. Overall, they have quick, friendly service and generous portions. If you're feeling Vietnamese food, check out Le's."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","photo_id":"7O8UMuWfmTgF6n_fHHQQyw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/7O8UMuWfmTgF6n_fHHQQyw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9002277851104736},{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","photo_id":"r0bQQhBfnkpe-BJn4c0P2g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/r0bQQhBfnkpe-BJn4c0P2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8723594546318054},{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","photo_id":"1Aq_vN9f_oyTVXcJrlOd9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1Aq_vN9f_oyTVXcJrlOd9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8120157718658447},{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","photo_id":"qk6NY5S6HOgxZCYWyWsa-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qk6NY5S6HOgxZCYWyWsa-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8050591945648193},{"business_id":"WO_5ViN3KaeYZaAxTSRjdg","photo_id":"AQkbCYr3Q8b33Rv_lFcx7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/ph